# GS-010: Salt can alter gas solubility without consuming the gas
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaCl 0.1mol
seal v2 500mL
add v2 CO2 0.001mol
inspect v2
